{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28582","headline":"使回枉唐州崔司马书兼寄四韵因和 · 杜牧","name":"使回枉唐州崔司马书兼寄四韵因和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清晨候吏把书来，十载离忧得暂开。\n痴叔去时还读易，仲容多兴索衔杯。\n人心计日殷勤望，马首随云早晚回。\n莫爲霜台愁岁暮，潜龙须待一声雷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28582.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28582","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}